flowchart TD
    %% Actors
    BPPOfficer[BPP Officer]
    Farmer[Farmer]
    GroupLeader[Farmer Group Leader]
    
    %% Start Process
    Start([Start: System Initialization]) --> SetupGeo[Setup Geographic Data]
    
    SetupGeo --> CreateProvinsi[Create Provinsi]
    CreateProvinsi --> CreateKabupaten[Create Kabupaten]
    CreateKabupaten --> CreateDinas[Create Dinas]
    CreateDinas --> CreateUpt[Create UPT]
    CreateUpt --> CreateBpp[Create BPP]
    CreateBpp --> CreateDesa[Create Desa]
    CreateDesa --> CreateKelompokTani[Create Kelompok Tani]
    CreateKelompokTani --> RegisterAnggota[Register Anggota Tani]
    
    RegisterAnggota --> RegisterLahan{Register Lahan?}
    RegisterLahan -->|Yes| CreateLahan[Create Lahan Record]
    RegisterLahan -->|No| SetupKomoditas[Setup Komoditas]
    CreateLahan --> SetupKomoditas
    
    SetupKomoditas --> CreateKomoditas[Create Komoditas]
    CreateKomoditas --> SetupBeban[Setup Beban Categories]
    
    SetupBeban --> CreateKategori[Create Kategori<br/>Variable/Fixed Classification]
    CreateKategori --> CreateBeban[Create Beban Types<br/>BBB/BTKL/BOP Classification]
    
    CreateBeban --> StartFarming[Start Farming Process]
    
    %% Planting Cycle Process
    StartFarming --> CreateTanam[Create Tanam Record<br/>Planting Cycle]
    CreateTanam --> RecordBeban[Record Cost Transaction]
    
    RecordBeban --> ClassifyCost{Classify Cost}
    ClassifyCost -->|Material| RecordBBB[Record BBB<br/>Material Cost]
    ClassifyCost -->|Labor| RecordBTKL[Record BTKL<br/>Labor Cost]
    ClassifyCost -->|Overhead| RecordBOP[Record BOP<br/>Overhead Cost]
    
    RecordBBB --> ClassifyBehavior{Classify Behavior}
    RecordBTKL --> ClassifyBehavior
    RecordBOP --> ClassifyBehavior
    
    ClassifyBehavior -->|Variable| RecordVariable[Record Variable Cost<br/>Quantity × Unit Price = Total]
    ClassifyBehavior -->|Fixed| RecordFixed[Record Fixed Cost<br/>Total Amount]
    
    RecordVariable --> ValidateTransaction[BPP Officer: Validate Transaction]
    RecordFixed --> ValidateTransaction
    
    ValidateTransaction --> CalculateTotal[Calculate Total Cost<br/>per Transaction]
    
    CalculateTotal --> Maintenance{Maintenance Phase?}
    Maintenance -->|Yes| RecordBeban
    Maintenance -->|No| HarvestTime{Harvest Time?}
    
    HarvestTime -->|No| Maintenance
    HarvestTime -->|Yes| RecordPanen[Record Harvest Event]
    
    RecordPanen --> MoreHarvest{More Harvest Events?}
    MoreHarvest -->|Yes| RecordPanen
    MoreHarvest -->|No| AggregateHarvest[Aggregate Harvest Data<br/>Total Revenue, Total Quantity<br/>Weighted Avg Selling Price]
    
    AggregateHarvest --> CalculateMetrics[Calculate Production Metrics]
    
    CalculateMetrics --> CalcBBB[Calculate BBB Total]
    CalculateMetrics --> CalcBTKL[Calculate BTKL Total]
    CalculateMetrics --> CalcBOP[Calculate BOP Total]
    CalculateMetrics --> CalcVariable[Calculate Total Variable Costs]
    CalculateMetrics --> CalcFixed[Calculate Total Fixed Costs]
    
    CalcBBB --> CalcProductionCost[Calculate Total Production Cost]
    CalcBTKL --> CalcProductionCost
    CalcBOP --> CalcProductionCost
    CalcVariable --> CalcProductionCost
    CalcFixed --> CalcProductionCost
    
    CalcProductionCost --> CalcProfit[Calculate Profit/Loss]
    CalcProfit --> CalcContributionMargin[Calculate Contribution Margin<br/>CM = Revenue - Variable Costs]
    CalcContributionMargin --> CalcCMUnit[Calculate CM per Unit]
    CalcCMUnit --> CalcBreakEven[Calculate Break-Even Point<br/>Units & Sales]
    
    CalcBreakEven --> GenerateReports[Generate Production Cost Reports]
    
    GenerateReports --> ReportCommodity[Report: Per Commodity]
    GenerateReports --> ReportCycle[Report: Per Planting Cycle]
    GenerateReports --> ReportFarmer[Report: Summarized by Farmer]
    GenerateReports --> ReportRegion[Report: Summarized by Region]
    GenerateReports --> ReportGroup[Report: Group-Level Summary<br/>Optional]
    
    ReportCommodity --> ViewReport[Farmer: View & Evaluate Reports]
    ReportCycle --> ViewReport
    ReportFarmer --> ViewReport
    ReportRegion --> ViewReport
    ReportGroup --> ViewGroupReport[Group Leader: View Group Reports]
    
    ViewReport --> EvaluateEfficiency[Farmer: Evaluate Efficiency<br/>Control Cost Drivers]
    EvaluateEfficiency --> MakeDecision[Farmer: Make Decisions<br/>Based on Profitability<br/>& Break-Even Thresholds]
    
    ViewGroupReport --> EndProcess([End: Process Complete])
    MakeDecision --> EndProcess
    
    %% Actor Connections
    BPPOfficer -.->|Input & Validate| ValidateTransaction
    BPPOfficer -.->|Generate| GenerateReports
    Farmer -.->|Benefit from| ViewReport
    Farmer -.->|Use for| EvaluateEfficiency
    GroupLeader -.->|View| ViewGroupReport
    
    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style EndProcess fill:#FFB6C1
    style CreateTanam fill:#87CEEB
    style RecordPanen fill:#FFD700
    style CalculateMetrics fill:#FFA500
    style GenerateReports fill:#DDA0DD
    style ValidateTransaction fill:#FF6347
    style ViewReport fill:#98FB98
    style BPPOfficer fill:#FFE4B5
    style Farmer fill:#E0E0E0
    style GroupLeader fill:#D3D3D3

